WEBVTT

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:38.200
As we were on the way to the
battle arena to fight Team Psykick,

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.870
we were put to sleep
inside of the bus.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:47.420
When we woke up, we were in some
unknown place, surrounded by forest.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:52.630
Do not worry! This is your arena.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.410
Go Shoot!

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:00.390
Go, Chameleon!

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:08.640
Attack!

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.810
Darn!

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:15.150
Go!

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:26.620
It seems as if their motive is to
capture the BBA team's Sacred Beasts.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:32.290
Max just barely won this
battle he was forced into...

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:36.260
but we can't continue to
accept these ridiculous battles.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:53.190
I thought I said escaping was pointless.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:56.110
This is a remote island in the south.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.500
I'm saved...

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.630
Why does this always
happen to you?

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:21.590
Shut up! Gimme a break!

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.800
Are you okay?

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.430
Yeah, I just sprained it.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:28.890
Let me see.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.560
It's swollen.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.530
What do you
think you're doing?!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.420
The tendon is injured.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:44.200
Don't push yourself.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.870
This is nothin'!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.250
I'm totally fine!

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.410
I just said don't push yourself.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:53.370
Well? What now?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.420
We head into the cave, duh.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.460
We just need three
more wins, right?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.090
Let's wrap this up
and go home.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:05.600
Are you nuts?
That's playing right into their hands!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.510
Hiromi is right.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:10.040
As you saw from Max's battle,

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.940
there has to be some weird
trap set into the stadiums.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:18.940
I think we should find a way to escape
so we can protect your Sacred Beasts.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.220
Not you too, Kyoujyu...

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:25.360
You say "escape" but
we <b>are on an island...</b>

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.460
I guess we just
have to battle, then.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.670
Look over there!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.590
What is it?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.340
It's a lighthouse.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.970
So what if it is?

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:46.270
Lighthouses usually
have those, don't they?

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:48.390
Like a radio or a
communication device!

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:53.680
I get it! We can use that to contact
Chairman Daitenji and have him save us, right?

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:54.640
Yeah!

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.520
How dumb are you guys?

00:04:56.770 --> 00:05:01.780
There's no way guys who would go out of
their way to capture us would leave that there.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.010
I bet they broke it.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.450
You don't know
until we try!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.950
Yeah, I do!

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:12.330
But we don't know if they'll actually
let us go if we win these battles!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.660
We should go check
out the lighthouse!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.210
No, we battle!

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.580
Lighthouse!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.960
Battle!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.420
Cut it out, you two!

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.800
This isn't the time to fight!

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.390
What if we split
into two groups?

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.680
Kyoujyu and Hiromi
will go to the lighthouse,

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.910
and we'll continue to battle.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.940
So we'll take a
chance on both, then.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.980
Good idea!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.730
Is that good with everyone?

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.520
Fine by me.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.150
I don't mind either.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.820
Hiromi can just do
what she wants.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.710
Even if it's a
waste of time.

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:51.700
I'm going to the
lighthouse, too.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:53.560
Kai!

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:56.220
You aren't coming with us?

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:59.130
I'm worried about what'll
happen if these two are left alone.

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:03.420
If Kai's with us then
I can be at ease!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:08.720
If anything happens, let's keep in
contact with the Battle Analyzers.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.800
With the Battle Analyzers?

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:15.890
Yes. The Battle Analyzer
also works as a transceiver!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.020
We'll be off, then.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.530
They split!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.200
Where do you think you're going?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.840
Mr. Kinomiya!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.470
I am absolutely sorry.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:54.510
It's my fault for accepting their challenge
without adequately looking into their background.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:58.730
More importantly, just who
the in the world are they?

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:03.810
I tried looking them up in
the BBA's global database,

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.030
but there's nothing
we know about them.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.860
Well, we needn't worry.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.370
Because I'm doing
everything in the BBA's power

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:16.540
to find the whereabouts of the bus
Takao and his friends were on.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.200
Is that so...?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.870
Keep yourself out of trouble...

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:31.550
Damn, we're just sitting on our hands here!
Can't they hurry up and find 'em?!

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:35.300
Calm down, Dunga.
We just have to wait.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:10.340
Kai Hiwatari has
arrived at point W-4.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.550
Activate system 729.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.640
System 729, activated.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.230
Get down!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.970
I think it settled...

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:42.620
Are you okay?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.140
Yeah...

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:47.380
Thank you...

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.510
Look at that!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.680
Now we can't go ahead!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.300
I hope you get it now.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.100
That there's no
option but to battle.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:06.650
Now turn around.
Turn around and accept our challenge!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.480
What should we do?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.860
What do we do, Kai?

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.990
We're going to the lighthouse.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.080
Mhm!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.620
We're going, too!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.470
Those damn kids...!

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.260
Not to worry.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:45.940
Even if they don't heed my warning,
they won't make it to the lighthouse.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:52.400
Destroy all of the bridges.
Force their path to point Y-6.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:53.440
Yes, sir.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.490
I wonder what they're doing?

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.830
We'll know when we get there.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.370
Either way, we keep
going to our destination.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:15.170
Tell Figuel to move to point Y-6!

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:15.920
Sir.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.050
We'll be waiting, Kai Hiwatari.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:24.350
Takao Kinomiya has
arrived at point R-2.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.190
Hey, let's take a break.

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.620
Are you okay, Takao?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.990
You look pretty worn out.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.830
I'm fine! A little sprain isn't enough to--

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.670
Activating system 841.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:04.850
Wait!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.610
What's with this truck?!

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.610
How should I know?!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.780
Stop!

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.620
This bridge is broken, too.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.830
The lighthouse is just ahead...

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.540
What do we do?

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:34.540
We keep looking.
There has to be a way to get there!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:36.960
Let's go.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:57.150
Takao, do something!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.940
Easier said than done!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:02.990
What.

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:08.620
--We're gonna fall!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:21.920
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.230
We're alive...

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:45.200
Are you trying to kill us?!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.240
Welcome to the second battle stadium.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.970
It just keeps getting darker.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:09.760
How are we supposed to battle in here?

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.890
We go and find out!

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:19.400
Sorry!

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:23.280
Rei! How many times have I
told you not to bump into me!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.490
What am I supposed to do about it?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.200
It's so dark in here I can't see a thing.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:31.740
Let's keep talking.
We'll know where each other are

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:33.500
and won't bump into each other.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.500
Yeah!

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.460
I'm countin' on ya, Rei!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.330
<b>"Yajirobe."
(balancing toy)</b>

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.180
<b>"Beibureedo."
(Beyblade)</b>

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:41.810
<b>"Doraguun."
(Dragoon)</b>

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:43.710
Oh, that ends with "n".

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:45.420
Then, <b>"doyoubi."
(Saturday)</b>

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.970
"Hiwatari Kai."

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:47.760
<b>"Ireba."
(a false tooth)</b>

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.970
<b>"Batoru kaijou!"
(battle arena)</b>

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:53.850
There it is!

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.810
Hey, wait for me!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.200
Whoa...

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:11.330
I can't believe this is
all set up down here.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:14.540
Welcome to the
stadium of darkness.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:16.790
Up there!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.710
Are you our next opponent?

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:24.420
Yes. I am the emperor
of the darkness!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.550
Bat!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:30.180
Get a load of Mr. "I am the
emperor of the darkness, Bat!" here...

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.010
Hurry up and get down here!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.140
Let's battle!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.240
Takao.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.640
Leave this one to me.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:36.770
What?!

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.390
You can't handle it
with your leg injured.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:41.520
I can't just back down
'cause of a little scratch!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.190
Don't overdo it.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.820
Let's let Rei take this one.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:45.610
Max...

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.570
Rei, they're after
our Sacred Beasts.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.860
Watch out.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:50.860
Yeah.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.950
Did you decide
who's going to battle?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.660
I'll fight you.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:27.440
Change the capture
system to type three.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.280
Capture system:
changed to type three.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.910
I'm going to get
you this time.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:39.250
Let's do this. Go Shoot!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.500
Driger!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.750
It dodged Driger?!

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:53.840
Do you think you can catch my
Battranzer with your feeble speed?

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.680
Darn! How about this?

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.560
Just try and dodge this!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:58.680
Driger!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:00.930
What?!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.350
Bat Attack!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.480
Rei!

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.570
It's so fast...

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:11.400
It's even difficult
for Driger to dodge...

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:18.130
I'm impressed that Driger
dodged the Bat Attack.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.650
But this is the end for you.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:22.210
Battranzer!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.090
What?!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.630
No way!

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.840
Go, Battranzer!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:48.940
Over there!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.730
Driger!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:54.570
It's gone!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:55.950
I'm right here!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:03.000
Rei, keep it together!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:03.830
Rei!

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.420
Go, Battranzer!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:11.960
Over here?

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:14.630
Or there?!

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.130
Right here!

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:21.430
How can he see Driger?

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.600
It's the goggles!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.230
That's low...

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.440
Damn it...

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.860
Adrenaline, 9,500.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:36.150
Heart status, 12,000!

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.700
Mental readings, 18,000!

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.080
Bro...

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.200
Here it comes...

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.630
I will not lose!

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:00.510
There it is!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.000
Is that Byakko?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.000
It's so cool!

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:08.020
Sacred Beast capture
system, activated.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:12.650
What?!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:13.570
Byakko!

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.830
What's the matter, Driger?

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:27.330
Is that the limit of your power?

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.210
Shoot!

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.920
Driger is slowing down!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.170
Adrenaline down to 4,000!

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.640
Heart status is down to 3,400!

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:42.390
Mental readings are down to 2,600.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:44.390
Bro...!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:45.770
We got it.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.230
Driger and Byakko are gonna lose!

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.940
What can he do?

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.980
It's over for you!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.220
Listen to the sound! The sound!

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:02.620
Sound? That's it!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.290
That way!

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:13.420
What?!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.880
Adrenaline, 12,000!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.840
Heart status, 18,000!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.800
What?!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:23.850
Vulcan Claw!

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:36.110
That's... impossible!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.650
--He did it!
--He did it!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.900
He did it! He won! He won!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.160
I won!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.040
It's crumbling down!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:06.430
There's the exit!

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:19.110
Report to Mr. Gideon.

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.400
Yes, sir.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.370
That was a close one.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.830
Even so, it was a great battle.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.790
You can thank Takao for that.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:35.250
Takao!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.380
Takao!

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:41.670
This is nothing.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.390
Did you find something?

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:53.100
No, we don't have
anything to go off of.

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.730
I see...

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:58.480
Takao...

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.490
Look over there!

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:07.700
It's a bridge.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.950
Cross that bridge and
we'll be at the lighthouse.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.200
Let's hurry!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.930
It's a battle stadium!

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:22.260
But how...?

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.970
I've been waiting for
you, Kai Hiwatari!

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:01.100
You can do it, Kai!

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:03.060
You can't lose to him!

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:06.150
What? Takao is battling?

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:09.400
He's injured! That's crazy!

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:12.740
That tears it. I will fight in Takao's place!

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:15.120
Hmm? What'd you say, Chairman Daitenji?

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:17.040
"You're the crazy one"?

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:20.290
How rude! Be sure to watch the next episode, okay?
